    "description": "Target gains Shield points equal to your Cha. If the target already has Shield points equal to or greater than your Cha, this spell has no effect, nor will this spell put the target at a Shield value greater than your Cha. (Shield points are temporary HP that absorb damage dealt to the unit. If all damage from an attack or effect is absorbed, any Stance damage that would normally accompany the attack or effect is negated.)<div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\">Uses: 2 per Divine Proficiency rank</div>",
